        "lastBuildDeployedOn": null,
        "title": "Setup the Source Control for Production Environment",
        "description": "<p class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\"><strong>Pre-Requisites<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">- Must have a Source Control Organization, under which respective repositories would be created<\/p>\n<p class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">- Source Control Connector must already be configured with privileges to access\/create respective repositories<\/p>\n<p class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\"><strong>Setup the Source Control for Production Environment<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">Setting up the source control&nbsp;for the production environment involves the following actions:<\/p>\n<ol class=\"font-size-13 muted-80\">\n<li class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">Maps logged in FortiSOAR user to specified Source Control user account, who has admin privileges, on the source control service.<\/li>\n<li class=\"font-size-13 muted-80\">Connects to a source control service and creates new repositories or links to an already created repository for storing 3 types of data\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\">\n<li>Production Content<\/li>\n<li>Production Settings<\/li>\n<li>Development Settings<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">Following <a href=\"\/editor\/exporter\/templates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Export Templates<\/a> that define content to be saved in the source control repositories.\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\">\n<li>Source Control - Production Content<\/li>\n<li>Source Control - Production Settings<\/li>\n<li>Source Control - Development Settings<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">Pushes initial content to the respective source control repositories<\/li>\n<\/ol>",
        "results": "",
        "sequence": 1,
        "recordIcon": "",
